# A two-storey house: living room, kitchen, a WC and a store downstairs, two bedrooms, a
# bathroom and a study upstairs, and one dog-leg stair joining the two floors.
# The plan file beside this one adds what rooms text has no words for: the site, with its
# plot, its ground level and its place, the United States, whose model codes are the only
# figures Grid applies today. Write it again with: grid write house.rooms --plan house.json
plan "Two-storey house"
walls outside 0.3 inside 0.1 height 2.6
windows sill 0.9 height 1.3

floor ground "Ground floor" level 0
room living  "Living room"        living   4.2 x 4.6  at 0.15,0.15
room kitchen "Kitchen and dining" kitchen  4.2 x 3.4  north of living
room hall    "Hall"               corridor 1.3 x *    east of living until kitchen
room stair   "Stair"              stair    2.0 x 3.4  east of hall through first
room wc      "WC"                 wc       2.0 x 1.5  north of stair
room store   "Store"              storage  2.0 x *    north of wc until hall
door front     in hall south, centred, 0.9 wide, opens in, hinged west
door d-living  between hall and living, 0.5 from south, 0.8 wide, opens into living, hinged south
door d-kitchen between hall and kitchen, 0.5 from north, 0.8 wide, opens into kitchen, hinged north
opening o-stair between hall and stair, 0.3 from south, 1.0 wide
door d-wc      between hall and wc, 0.3 from south of wc, 0.7 wide, opens into wc, hinged south
door d-store   between hall and store, 0.3 from south of store, 0.7 wide, opens into store, hinged south
door back      in kitchen west, 0.6 from north, 0.9 wide, opens in, hinged north
window w-living  in living south, 1.2 from west, 1.8 wide, sill 0.6, height 1.5
window w-living2 in living west, 1.6 from south, 1.2 wide
window w-kitchen in kitchen north, 1.3 from west, 1.6 wide, sill 1.0, height 1.1
window w-wc      in wc east, centred, 0.5 wide, sill 1.4, height 0.7

floor first "First floor" level 1
room bed1    "Bedroom 1" bedroom  4.2 x 4.6  at 0.15,0.15
room bed2    "Bedroom 2" bedroom  4.2 x 3.4  north of bed1
room landing "Landing"   corridor 1.3 x *    east of bed1 until bed2
room bath    "Bathroom"  bathroom 2.0 x 2.4  north of stair
room study   "Study"     study    2.0 x *    north of bath until landing
opening o-stair-up between landing and stair, 0.3 from south, 1.0 wide
door d-bed1  between landing and bed1, 0.5 from south, 0.8 wide, opens into bed1, hinged south
door d-bed2  between landing and bed2, 0.5 from north, 0.8 wide, opens into bed2, hinged north
door d-bath  between landing and bath, 0.3 from south of bath, 0.7 wide, opens into bath, hinged south
door d-study between landing and study, 0.3 from north, 0.8 wide, opens into study, hinged north
window w-bed1  in bed1 south, 1.2 from west, 1.6 wide
window w-bed2  in bed2 north, 1.3 from west, 1.4 wide
window w-bath  in bath east, centred, 0.6 wide, sill 1.4, height 0.7
window w-study in study north, centred, 1.0 wide
